<title>FRANCE: France sells maize, wheat flour in food aid tender.</title>
<headline>France sells maize, wheat flour in food aid tender.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>France sold 8,250 tonnes of maize to Cape Verde and 3,650 tonnes of soft wheat flour to Sierra Leone at a food aid tender held last week, France's grain office ONIC said on Monday.</p>
<p>It sold the maize at 1,114 francs per tonne, FOB Blaye, and the flour at 1,692 francs per tonne FOB Rouen, it said. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
